#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_51
msgid "2. <strong>Keep Code Organized with Indentation</strong>"
msgstr "2. <strong>ຈັດລະບຽບໂຄ້ດດ້ວຍການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
