#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting</strong>: Manage revenues, taxes, and financial reports "
"from course sales."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການບັນຊີ</strong>: ຈັດການລາຍຮັບ, ພາສີ ແລະ ບົດລາຍງານການເງິນຈາກການຂາຍຫຼັກສູດ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Apps &amp; What They Do:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ແອັບຕ່າງໆ &amp; ໜ້າທີ່ການເຮັດວຽກ:</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automate communications: </strong>Set up automated emails for course "
"completion reminders, certificates, or upselling new courses."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບສື່ສານອັດຕະໂນມັດ: </strong>ຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມວອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຮຽນຈົບຫຼັກສູດ, "
"ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ຫຼື ແນະນຳຫຼັກສູດໃໝ່."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "<strong>Breaking Down Problems into Steps</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການແບ່ງບັນຫາອອກເປັນແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Bundle your offers: </strong>Create course packages to increase "
"perceived value and average cart size.<strong/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລວມຊຸດຂໍ້ສະເໜີ: </strong>ສ້າງແພັກເກດຫຼັກສູດລວມກັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມມູນຄ່າ ແລະ ຍອດສັ່ງຊື້ສະເລ່ຍ."
"<strong/><br/>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,description:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>C and C++</strong> give programmers more control over how computers "
"manage resources and are often used in systems programming or high-"
"performance applications."
msgstr ""
"<strong>C ແລະ C++</strong> "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການຈັດການຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງຄອມພິວເຕີໄດ້ລະອຽດກວ່າ ແລະ "
"ມັກຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນການພັດທະນາລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ຫຼື ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປະສິດທິພາບສູງ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>C and C++</strong>: These languages give programmers low-level "
"control over how memory and hardware are used. That makes them perfect for "
"performance-heavy applications like video games, operating systems, and "
"embedded devices. For instance, much of Microsoft Windows and many game "
"engines are written in C++."
msgstr ""
"<strong>C ແລະ C++</strong>: "
"ພາສາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນັກພັດທະນາສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ "
"ຮາດແວໃນລະດັບພື້ນຖານໄດ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດ. ຈຶ່ງເໝາະສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປະສິດທິພາບການປະມວນຜົນສູງ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ວິດີໂອເກມ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນຝັງຕົວ (embedded devices). ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ໂຄງສ້າງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ Microsoft Windows ແລະ ເກມເອນຈິນ (Game engine) "
"ຫຼາຍໆຕົວແມ່ນຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ C++."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Certifications</strong>: Issue completion certificates automatically."
msgstr "<strong>ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ</strong>: ອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈົບຫຼັກສູດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "<strong>Check your logic manually</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມເຫດຜົນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ</strong>:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_51
msgid "<strong>Clean Version:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ເວີຊັນທີ່ສະອາດເປັນລະບຽບ:</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Community building</strong>: Use Odoo’s Forum and Reviews features "
"to stimulate peer-to-peer support."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການສ້າງຊຸມຊົນ</strong>: ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນເວັບບອດສົນທະນາ (Forum) ແລະ ການໃຫ້ຄຳເຫັນ "
"(Reviews) ຂອງ Odoo ເພື່ອກະຕຸ້ນການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເຊິ່ງກັນແລະກັນລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ຮຽນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Continuous improvement</strong>: Assign responsible managers to keep "
"content evolving."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການພັດທະນາຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ</strong>: "
"ມອບໝາຍຜູ້ຮັບຜິດຊອບເພື່ອຄອຍປັບປຸງເນື້ອຫາໃຫ້ທັນສະໄໝຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "<strong>Custom range</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ກຳນົດຂອບເຂດເອງ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Dashboards</strong>: Monitor KPIs like course sales, student "
"engagement, or marketing performance in real time."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໜ້າປັດລາຍງານ (Dashboards)</strong>: ຕິດຕາມຕົວຊີ້ວັດຫຼັກ (KPIs) ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຍອດຂາຍຫຼັກສູດ, ການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມຂອງຜູ້ຮຽນ ຫຼື ປະສິດທິຜົນທາງການຕະຫຼາດໄດ້ແບບສົດໆ (Real-time)."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "<strong>Draw it out</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ແຕ້ມແຜນວາດອອກມາ</strong>:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Engage through social media: </strong>Repurpose snippets of your "
"lessons into posts or teasers to drive traffic back to your platform."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສ້າງການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມຜ່ານສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍ: </strong>ນຳບາງສ່ວນຂອງບົດຮຽນມາຕັດເປັນໂພສຕ໌ ຫຼື "
"ວິດີໂອສັ້ນເພື່ອດຶງດູດຄົນເຂົ້າມາສູ່ແພລັດຟອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Engagement analytics</strong>: Measure clicks, open rates, and "
"conversions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການວິເຄາະການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ</strong>: ວັດແທກຍອດຄລິກ, ອັດຕາການເປີດອ່ານ ແລະ "
"ອັດຕາການປ່ຽນມາເປັນລູກຄ້າ (conversions)."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Feedback &amp; reviews</strong>: Collect star ratings and comments."
msgstr "<strong>ຄຳຕອບຮັບ &amp; ບົດວິຈານ</strong>: ເກັບກຳຄະແນນດາວ ແລະ ຄວາມຄິດເຫັນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Gamification</strong>: Add leaderboards, badges, and XP points for "
"learner engagement."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການປະຍຸກໃຊ້ເກມ (Gamification)</strong>: ເພີ່ມຕາຕະລາງອັນດັບ, ຫຼຽນລາງວັນ ແລະ "
"ຄະແນນ XP ເພື່ອກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ຜູ້ຮຽນມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Gamify your courses: </strong>Add badges and leaderboards to "
"encourage competition and motivation."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສ້າງຄວາມມ່ວນຊື່ນໃຫ້ຫຼັກສູດ: </strong>ເພີ່ມຫຼຽນລາງວັນ ແລະ "
"ຕາຕະລາງຈັດອັນດັບເພື່ອສ້າງແຮງຈູງໃຈ ແລະ ການແຂ່ງຂັນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:elearning_platform.default_product_course_product_template
msgid "<strong>Gardening from A to Z – Lifetime Course Access</strong>"
msgstr ""

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Go (Golang)</strong>: Created by Google, Go is simple, fast, and "
"great for building scalable web servers or cloud applications. It’s used in "
"backend systems that handle millions of requests per second."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Go (Golang)</strong>: ພັດທະນາໂດຍ Google, ເປັນພາສາທີ່ລຽບງ່າຍ, ໄວ ແລະ "
"ເໝາະສຳລັບການສ້າງເຊີບເວີເວັບ ຫຼື ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຄລາວທີ່ຮອງຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍຕົວ. "
"ມັກຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານທີ່ຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບຄຳຂໍນັບລ້ານຄັ້ງຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.homepage
msgid "<strong>Guidance You Can Trust</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຄຳແນະນຳທີ່ທ່ານໄວ້ວາງໃຈໄດ້</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "<strong>Guided Exercise: A Number Guessing Game</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ບົດເຝິກຫັດພ້ອມຄຳແນະນຳ: ເກມທວາຍຕົວເລກ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "<strong>High-level problem:</strong> <em>“Make toast.”</em>"
msgstr "<strong>ບັນຫາໃນພາບລວມ:</strong> <em>“ປີ້ງເຂົ້າຈີ່.”</em>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_51
msgid ""
"<strong>Hint:</strong> Use meaningful variable names, indentation, and maybe "
"a function."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄຳແນະນຳ:</strong> ຕັ້ງຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນໃຫ້ມີຄວາມໝາຍ, ຈັດຫຍໍ້ໜ້າໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະສ້າງຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍນຳ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "<strong>Identify repeated patterns</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ຊອກຫາຮູບແບບທີ່ເຮັດຊ້ຳກັນ</strong>:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Internal use</strong>: Assign courses free of charge for employee "
"onboarding or training."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການນຳໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ</strong>: ກຳນົດຫຼັກສູດໃຫ້ພະນັກງານຮຽນຟຣີ ສຳລັບການຝຶກອົບຮົມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື "
"ການພັດທະນາບຸກຄະລາກອນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,description:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Java</strong> is popular for large applications, Android apps, and "
"enterprise systems."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Java</strong> ເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ແອັບ Android ແລະ "
"ລະບົບລະດັບອົງກອນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Java</strong>: A powerful, general-purpose language that runs on "
"everything from large enterprise servers to Android phones. Its motto, "
"<em>“Write once, run anywhere”</em>, reflects how portable it is. A banking "
"system backend or an Android mobile game are often written in Java."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Java</strong>: ພາສາອະເນກປະສົງທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ "
"ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເຊີບເວີອົງກອນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໄປຈົນເຖິງໂທລະສັບ Android. ຄຳຂວັນທີ່ວ່າ "
"<em>“ຂຽນຄັ້ງດຽວ, ໃຊ້ໄດ້ທຸກບ່ອນ”</em> ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນຂອງມັນ. "
"ລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານຂອງທະນາຄານ ຫຼື ເກມມືຖືໃນ Android ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນຂຽນດ້ວຍ Java."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,description:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>JavaScript</strong> powers most websites, making pages interactive "
"and dynamic."
msgstr ""
"<strong>JavaScript</strong> ເປັນຫົວໃຈຫຼັກຂອງເວັບໄຊສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າເວັບມີການໂຕ້ຕອບ ແລະ "
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງແບບໄດນາມິກ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>JavaScript</strong>: The language of the web. Every time you click a "
"button, scroll smoothly, or see live updates on a webpage, JavaScript is at "
"work. It runs inside your browser and powers dynamic sites like Facebook, "
"Twitter, and YouTube. For example, the code that updates a shopping cart "
"total instantly when you add an item is written in JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"<strong>JavaScript</strong>: ພາສາແຫ່ງໂລກເວັບ. ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານກົດປຸ່ມ, ເລື່ອນໜ້າຈໍແບບລ່ຽນໄຫຼ ຫຼື "
"ເຫັນການອັບເດດສົດໆເທິງໜ້າເວັບ ນັ້ນແມ່ນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ JavaScript. ມັນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພາຍໃນບຣາວເຊີ "
"ແລະ ຂັບເຄື່ອນເວັບໄຊທີ່ມີການໂຕ້ຕອບຢ່າງ Facebook, Twitter ແລະ YouTube. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ລະຫັດທີ່ອັບເດດຍອດລວມໃນກະຕ່າສິນຄ້າທັນທີເມື່ອທ່ານກົດເພີ່ມສິນຄ້າ ກໍຖືກຂຽນດ້ວຍ JavaScript."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Knowledge</strong> &amp; <strong>Documents</strong>: Centralize your "
"internal documentation for trainers and staff."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄັງຄວາມຮູ້ (Knowledge)</strong> &amp; <strong>ເອກະສານ (Documents)</"
"strong>: ສູນລວມເອກະສານພາຍໃນສຳລັບວິທະຍາກອນ ແລະ ພະນັກງານ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Leverage analytics: </strong>Track student progress to identify "
"bottlenecks and adjust course content accordingly."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ນຳໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກການວິເຄາະ: </strong>ຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງຜູ້ຮຽນເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາຈຸດຕິດຂັດ "
"ແລະ ປັບປຸງເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກສູດໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "<strong>Limit the number of attempts</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ກຳນົດຈຳນວນຄັ້ງໃນການທວາຍ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Marketing apps</strong>: Send targeted campaigns to promote courses "
"&amp; connect and engage audiences through multiple social platforms."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບການຕະຫຼາດ</strong>: ສົ່ງແຄມເປນທີ່ເຈາະຈົງກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍເພື່ອໂຄສະນາຫຼັກສູດ &amp; "
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ສ້າງການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມກັບຜູ້ຊົມຜ່ານຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງສື່ສັງຄົມ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_51
msgid "<strong>Messy Version:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນລະບຽບ:</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "<strong>Play again option</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຕົວເລືອກຫຼິ້ນໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid ""
"<strong>Problem:</strong> You want to write a program that makes an ATM "
"simulate a cash withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໂຈດບັນຫາ:</strong> ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມເພື່ອຈຳລອງການຖອນເງິນສົດຈາກຕູ້ ATM."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Projects</strong>: Organize course development and track future "
"content roadmaps."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໂຄງການ (Projects)</strong>: ຈັດລະບຽບການພັດທະນາຫຼັກສູດ ແລະ "
"ຕິດຕາມແຜນພັດທະນາເນື້ອຫາໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,description:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Python</strong> is known for being beginner-friendly and widely used "
"in data science, web development, and automation."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Python</strong> ມີຊື່ສຽງເລື່ອງຄວາມງ່າຍສຳລັບຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງໃນວິທະຍາສາດຂໍ້ມູນ, ການພັດທະນາເວັບ ແລະ ລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Python</strong>: Famous for its simplicity, Python reads almost like "
"English, making it a favorite for beginners. It’s widely used in data "
"science, artificial intelligence, web development (using frameworks like "
"Django), and automation. Example: writing a program that analyzes thousands "
"of tweets to find trending topics."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Python</strong>: ໂດດເດັ່ນເລື່ອງຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍ ອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍຄືພາສາອັງກິດ "
"ຈຶ່ງເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມຫຼາຍສຳລັບຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງໃນວຽກງານວິທະຍາສາດຂໍ້ມູນ, ປັນຍາປະດິດ (AI), "
"ການພັດທະນາເວັບ (ຜ່ານເຟຣມເວີກ ເຊັ່ນ: Django) ແລະ ລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມວິເຄາະຂໍ້ຄວາມທະວີດຫຼາຍພັນຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ກຳລັງຕິດກະແສ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,description:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Ruby, Go, Swift, and others</strong> serve specialized roles across "
"industries."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ruby, Go, Swift ແລະ ອື່ນໆ</strong> "
"ຕ່າງກໍມີບົດບາດສະເພາະດ້ານໃນແຕ່ລະຂະແໜງອຸດສາຫະກຳ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Ruby</strong>: Known for its elegance and developer-friendly design. "
"Popular in web development thanks to Ruby on Rails, it was once the backbone "
"of platforms like Airbnb and GitHub."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ruby</strong>: ໂດດເດັ່ນເລື່ອງຄວາມສວຍງາມ ແລະ ການອອກແບບທີ່ເປັນມິດກັບນັກພັດທະນາ. "
"ເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມໃນການພັດທະນາເວັບຜ່ານ Ruby on Rails ແລະ ເຄີຍເປັນໂຄງສ້າງຫຼັກໃຫ້ແກ່ແພລັດຟອມຊື່ດັງ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"Airbnb ແລະ GitHub."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Sales reports</strong>: Monitor revenues and identify popular "
"courses."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ບົດລາຍງານການຂາຍ</strong>: ຕິດຕາມຍອດລາຍຮັບ ແລະ ກວດສອບຫຼັກສູດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມນິຍົມ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "<strong>Show the number of attempts taken</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ສະແດງຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ໄດ້ທວາຍໄປ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Social scheduling</strong>: Plan posts across multiple platforms."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຕາຕະລາງໂພສຕ໌ສື່ສັງຄົມ</strong>: ວາງແຜນການໂພສຕ໌ເນື້ອຫາລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອມ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "<strong>Start broad, then refine</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ເລີ່ມຈາກພາບລວມກວ້າງໆ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລົງລາຍລະອຽດ</strong>:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Surveys</strong>: Gather learner feedback to continuously improve "
"course quality."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແບບສຳຫຼວດ</strong>: ເກັບກຳຄວາມຄິດເຫັນຂອງຜູ້ຮຽນເພື່ອພັດທະນາຄຸນນະພາບຫຼັກສູດຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_43
msgid ""
"<strong>Swift</strong>: Apple’s language for iOS and macOS development. If "
"you’ve ever used an iPhone app, there’s a good chance it was written in "
"Swift."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Swift</strong>: ພາສາຂອງ Apple ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາໃນ iOS ແລະ macOS. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານເຄີຍໃຊ້ແອັບເທິງ iPhone ແມ່ນມີໂອກາດສູງຫຼາຍທີ່ແອັບນັ້ນຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ Swift."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Targeted email campaigns</strong>: Segment learners by interests or "
"past purchases."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແຄມເປນອີເມວສະເພາະກຸ່ມ</strong>: ແບ່ງກຸ່ມຜູ້ຮຽນຕາມຄວາມສົນໃຈ ຫຼື ປະຫວັດການສັ່ງຊື້ຜ່ານມາ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "<strong>Think about inputs and outputs</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ພິຈາລະນາຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ (Inputs) ແລະ ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ (Outputs)</strong>:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Tip </strong>: Check out Marketing Automation for content funnel "
"optimization."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄຳແນະນຳ </strong>: ລອງໃຊ້ລະບົບການຕະຫຼາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Marketing Automation) "
"ເພື່ອປັບປຸງເສັ້ນທາງການຕະຫຼາດ (Funnel) ໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິຜົນສູງສຸດ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Tip: </strong>Use pricelists for discounts, gifts, and promotions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄຳແນະນຳ: </strong>ນຳໃຊ້ລາຍການລາຄາ (Pricelists) ສຳລັບສ່ວນຫຼຸດ, ຂອງຂວັນ ແລະ "
"ໂປຣໂມຊັນຕ່າງໆ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Track student progression</strong>: See which modules they’ve "
"completed."
msgstr "<strong>ຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງຜູ້ຮຽນ</strong>: ເບິ່ງໄດ້ວ່າຜູ້ຮຽນຮຽນຈົບບົດໃດແດ່ແລ້ວ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Website integration</strong>: Courses are published directly on your "
"Odoo website."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເວັບໄຊ</strong>: ຫຼັກສູດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໂດຍກົງເທິງເວັບໄຊ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Website</strong>: Present your training catalog beautifully and "
"provide an easy-to-navigate user experience."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເວັບໄຊ</strong>: ນຳສະເໜີລາຍການຫຼັກສູດຝຶກອົບຮົມຢ່າງສວຍງາມ ແລະ "
"ມອບປະສົບການການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_51
msgid "<strong>Writing Clean, Readable Code</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການຂຽນໂຄ້ດໃຫ້ສະອາດ ແລະ ອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ</strong>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>eCommerce</strong>: Sell your courses online with integrated "
"payments and automated access."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ອີຄອມເມີຊ (eCommerce)</strong>: ຂາຍຫຼັກສູດອອນລາຍພ້ອມລະບົບຊຳລະເງິນໃນຕົວ ແລະ "
"ລະບົບອະນຸຍາດເຂົ້າຮຽນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>eLearning</strong>: Build, structure, and publish courses with "
"lessons, quizzes, gamification, and certifications."
msgstr ""
"<strong>eLearning</strong>: ສ້າງ, ຈັດໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ຫຼັກສູດ ພ້ອມບົດຮຽນ, ແບບທົດສອບ, "
"ອົງປະກອບເກມ ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid ""
"<strong>if/elif/else</strong> checks the guess against the secret number and "
"gives feedback."
msgstr ""
"<strong>if/elif/else</strong> ກວດສອບຕົວເລກທີ່ທວາຍທຽບໃສ່ຕົວເລກລັບ ແລ້ວສົ່ງຄຳຕອບແນະນຳ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid ""
"<strong>import random</strong> brings in Python’s random number generator."
msgstr ""
"<strong>import random</strong> ເປັນການດຶງເອົາໂມດູນສຸ່ມຕົວເລກຂອງ Python ມາໃຊ້ງານ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid ""
"<strong>random.randint(1, 20)</strong> picks a secret number between 1 and "
"20."
msgstr "<strong>random.randint(1, 20)</strong> ສຸ່ມເລືອກຕົວເລກລັບລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 20."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid ""
"A human might know what to do, but a computer doesn’t. So we break it down:"
msgstr "ມະນຸດອາດຈະຮູ້ວ່າຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຍັງ ແຕ່ຄອມພິວເຕີບໍ່ຮູ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງແບ່ງອອກເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນຍ່ອຍ:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:elearning_platform.product_template_73
msgid "A solid foundation to branch into more advanced IT studies"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານອັນໜັກແໜ້ນເພື່ອກ້າວໄປສູ່ການຮຽນໄອທີ (IT) ໃນລະດັບສູງ"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_42
msgid "Add 1 slice of cheese."
msgstr "ວາງເນີຍແຂງລົງໄປ 1 ແຜ່ນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "Add the two variables together."
msgstr "ເອົາສອງຕົວປ່ຽນມາບວກເຂົ້າກັນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "After a correct guess, ask:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທວາຍຖືກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຖາມວ່າ:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.homepage
msgid "Amazing Courses&amp;nbsp;"
msgstr "ຫຼັກສູດທີ່ຍອດຢ້ຽມ&amp;nbsp;"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.homepage
msgid ""
"Analyzing the numbers behind our success: an in-depth look at the key "
"metrics driving our company's achievements."
msgstr ""
"ວິເຄາະຕົວເລກເບື້ອງຫຼັງຄວາມສຳເລັດຂອງພວກເຮົາ: ເຈາະເລິກຕົວຊີ້ວັດຫຼັກທີ່ຂັບເຄື່ອນຜົນສຳເລັດຂອງອົງກອນ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "Ask the player to enter a guess."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນປ້ອນຕົວເລກທີ່ຕ້ອງການທວາຍ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "Ask the user for their PIN."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດ PIN."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "Ask the user how much money they want to withdraw."
msgstr "ຖາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ວ່າຕ້ອງການຖອນເງິນເທົ່າໃດ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid ""
"At first, it seems simple: <em>“Add two numbers and show the result.”</em>"
msgstr "ຕອນທຳອິດອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືງ່າຍ: <em>“ບວກເລກສອງຈຳນວນ ແລ້ວສະແດງຜົນ.”</em>"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "Bake for 45 minutes."
msgstr "ອົບເປັນເວລາ 45 ນາທີ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_52
msgid "Before coding, let’s break down the problem (algorithmic thinking):"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຂຽນໂຄ້ດ, ມາແຍກບັນຫາອອກເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນກັນກ່ອນ (ການຄິດແບບອັລກໍຣິທຶມ):"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.homepage
msgid ""
"Behind every lesson is a team of experienced instructors and creators. With "
"practical insights and step-by-step support, you’ll never feel lost on your "
"learning journey."
msgstr ""
"ເບື້ອງຫຼັງທຸກບົດຮຽນຄືທີມງານຜູ້ສອນ ແລະ ຜູ້ສ້າງສັນທີ່ມີປະສົບການ. ດ້ວຍຄວາມຮູ້ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ຕົວຈິງ ແລະ "
"ການແນະນຳຢ່າງເປັນຂັ້ນເປັນຕອນ, ທ່ານຈະໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເສັ້ນທາງການຮຽນຮູ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "Break it down into steps:"
msgstr "ແບ່ງອອກເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model:slide.slide,name:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "Breaking Down Problems into Steps"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງບັນຫາອອກເປັນແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid ""
"Breaking problems into steps is about <strong>thinking like a computer</"
"strong>: precise, logical, and systematic. Once you learn to decompose "
"problems, writing the actual code becomes far less intimidating. It’s like "
"translating from everyday goals into a language the computer can execute."
msgstr ""
"ການແບ່ງບັນຫາອອກເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນແມ່ນ <strong>ການຄິດຄືກັບຄອມພິວເຕີ</strong>: ຖືກຕ້ອງຊັດເຈນ, "
"ມີເຫດຜົນ ແລະ ເປັນລະບົບ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຮຽນຮູ້ການແຍກຍ່ອຍບັນຫາແລ້ວ, "
"ການຂຽນໂຄ້ດຕົວຈິງຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນເລື່ອງໜ້າຍ້ານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. "
"ມັນປຽບເໝືອນການແປເປົ້າໝາຍໃນຊີວິດປະຈຳວັນໄປເປັນພາສາທີ່ຄອມພິວເຕີສາມາດປະຕິບັດຕາມໄດ້."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.homepage
msgid "Build Skills for Life"
msgstr "ສ້າງທັກສະຕິດໂຕຕະຫຼອດຊີວິດ"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:elearning_platform.product_template_67
msgid "Build confidence. Build furniture. Build your future. 🪚"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈ. ສ້າງເຄື່ອງເຮືອນ. ສ້າງອະນາຄົດຂອງທ່ານ. 🪚"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.homepage
msgid "Build the Pieces You’ll Love"
msgstr "ສ້າງສັນຜົນງານທີ່ທ່ານຈະຫຼົງຮັກ"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Building and running an eLearning platform can be complex: you need to "
"create engaging content, attract learners, manage access, and track progress "
"seamlessly."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ ແລະ ດຳເນີນງານແພລັດຟອມ eLearning ອາດມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນ: ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ, "
"ດຶງດູດຜູ້ຮຽນ, ຈັດການສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_42
msgid "But a computer would need:"
msgstr "ແຕ່ຄອມພິວເຕີຈະຕ້ອງການຂັ້ນຕອນລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid "But to write code, we need to expand this into steps:"
msgstr "ແຕ່ເພື່ອຈະຂຽນໂຄ້ດໄດ້, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຂະຫຍາຍສິ່ງນີ້ອອກເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນຍ່ອຍ:"

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elearning_platform.homepage
msgid "Carousel indicator"
