msgstr "ກົດຄັນໂຍກຂອງເຕົາປີ້ງເຂົ້າຈີ່ລົງ."

#. module: elearning_platform
#: model_terms:slide.slide,html_content:elearning_platform.slide_slide_50
msgid ""
"Pretend you are the computer and follow the steps. If you can’t complete the "
